<Doc lang="en" title="Terms" path="/terms" updated="29 October 2026">
  <p>These terms cover your use of dressyouapp.com. The DressYou app will come with its own terms.</p>
  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>The site presents DressYou and what the app will do. It has no account and nothing to buy. You can leave your email to hear when the app is out, as the privacy notice explains. You may browse the site freely for personal, non-commercial use.</p>
  <h2>What the site shows</h2>
  <p>The screens, people, garments and prices on this site illustrate how DressYou works. The people and garments are illustrations, and the shops, prices and conversations are examples, not offers.</p>
  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The DressYou name, logo, design and text belong to DressYou Technologies. Copying or reusing them needs our written permission.</p>
  <h2>Availability</h2>
  <p>We try to keep the site available and accurate, but it can change, pause or contain mistakes. We are not liable for any loss that comes from using it, as far as the law allows.</p>
  <h2>Law</h2>
  <p>French law applies to these terms. Questions go to <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>{LINKS.email}</a>.</p>
